Ach!

283
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:02,480
Ach!

284
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:03,220
Ach!

285
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:03,680
Ach!

286
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:04,460
Ach!

287
00:19:04,460 --> 00:19:04,820
Ach!

288
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:05,080
Ach!

289
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:05,660
Ach!

290
